Package: riscos-support
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rolpkg
Description: The Linux side of RISC OS on Linux
 What runs RISC OS on Linux: init, rol-fb (screen, keyboard and mouse),
 rol-snd (sound), rol-netd (network and Wi-Fi), rol-cmd (Linux commands
 for RISC OS, with the root password), rol-usbd (USB devices for RISC
 OS), QEMU for machines that can't run 32-bit code (qemu-arm-riscos),
 NativeSupport, and this repository's source and key. A restart puts a
 new version to use.
